Every query is a case-insensitive regular expression, over the text by default:

  loccy-tool search Reservierung --locale de
  loccy-tool search Reservierung Buchung Termin --locale de
  loccy-tool search 'Could ?n.t' --locale en

--key matches the keypath instead, for the other question: which message is this key from
source, or what sits under this group. Alone it is the whole search; with a term it narrows it.

  loccy-tool search --key login
  loccy-tool search --key '^Tickets\\..*Tooltip$'
